# TLSA (DANE) Record Placeholder
# 
# This file would contain TLSA records for DANE (DNS-based Authentication of 
# Named Entities) to enable TLS certificate verification via DNS.
# 
# Format: <usage> <selector> <matching-type> <certificate-association-data>
#
# Example:
# 3 1 1 <SHA-256 hash of SPKI from certificate>
# 2 1 1 <SHA-256 hash of full certificate>
#
# For this repository (static hosting on GitHub Pages):
# GitHub uses their own certificates, so DANE would not be applicable.
#
# For a live Trigger service, this would contain:
# Usage 3 (DANE-EE) - End Entity certificate
# Selector 1 (SPKI) - Subject Public Key Info
# Matching Type 1 (SHA-256) - SHA-256 hash
#
# NOTE: TLSA records are NOW DEFINED in security/bind9/trigger.zone
# This file is kept for compatibility. The authoritative TLSA records 
# should be in DNS, not in .well-known/. See security/bind9/trigger.zone
# for the actual DNS records.
